          "id": "f8095647-3291-4fa9-a20e-ac5d35db0ad4",
          "name": "Atlassian Add Share Permission",
          "request": {
            "name": "Atlassian Add Share Permission",
            "description": {
              "content": "Add a share permissions to a filter. If you add a global share permission (one for all logged-in users or the public) it will overwrite all share permissions for the filter.<br><br>Be aware that this operation uses different objects for updating share permissions compared to [Update filter](#api-rest-api-3-filter-id-put).<br><br>**[Permissions](#permissions) required:** *Share dashboards and filters* [global permission](https://confluence.atlassian.com/x/x4dKLg) and the user must own the filter.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "rest",
                "api",
                "3",
                "filter",
                ":id",
                "permission"
